  "goodToKnow": "Der Kaufvertrag is a purchase contract. Legally, even buying bread is a Kaufvertrag under the BGB, made by offer and acceptance. A Kaufvertrag for land or a flat must be notariell beurkundet (notarised); the notary reads the whole contract aloud. Private car sales use a written Kaufvertrag, often with Gewährleistungsausschluss (no warranty). Plural: die Kaufverträge."
